  "description": "A military government that rules over Espers and citizens through exclusive management of guides. Nuka, an unregistered Esper who has been living by taking illegal guide drugs, is one day kidnapped by the military's guide Astin. Isolated in the military under the pretext of Esper management, Nuka is fascinated by Astin's powerful guiding and says, \"You will have to consider being guided by me as the honor of your life.\" With Astin's continued guiding, Nuka is able to live a normal life, but he is confused by Astin's unexpected identity and his own past... Will Nuka be able to overcome his mysterious life in the military?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
